OL,3,AKing and Macron arrive for sneak
OL,4,Apreview of landmark Bayeux Tapestry
OL,5,Aexhibition
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles, French President Emmanuel
OL,8,FMacron and UK Prime Minister Andy
OL,9,FBurnham have arrived at the British
OL,10,FMuseum for a preview of the Bayeux
OL,11,FTapestry exhibition, which is set to be
OL,12,Fone of the blockbuster cultural events
OL,13,Fof the year.
OL,15,FThe visit on Wednesday evening comes
OL,16,Fahead of the medieval tapestry going on
OL,17,Fpublic display in London from 10
OL,18,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
