OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKing and Macron arrive for sneak
OL,4,Apreview of landmark Bayeux Tapestry
OL,5,Aexhibition
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 70m (230ft) tapestry, originally
OL,8,Fembroidered in England but kept for
OL,9,Fcenturies in France, tells the story of
OL,10,Fthe Norman Conquest and the Battle of
OL,11,FHastings in 1066.
OL,13,FPresident Macron said the loan of the
OL,14,Fnational treasure until July 2027 was a
OL,15,F"powerful symbol" of the close ties
OL,16,Fbetween the UK and France.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
